@api = http://localhost:5000

### 200 - API status
GET {{api}}/

### 200 - Assignments
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 201 - Create submission
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"assignmentId":1,"studentCode":"DTC245200873","repositoryUrl":"https://github.com/stickman006/CNTTK23D"}

### 400 - Empty student code
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"assignmentId":1,"studentCode":"","repositoryUrl":"https://github.com/stickman006/CNTTK23D"}

### 400 - Invalid assignment ID
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"assignmentId":0,"studentCode":"DTC245200873","repositoryUrl":"https://github.com/stickman006/CNTTK23D"}

### 200 - Run the named createSubmission request first
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 404 - Unknown submission
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

